  "historyNote": "#745, eff 1-25-76; ss by #2263, eff 1-7-83; ss by #2839, eff 8-31-84; ss by #4868, eff 7-20-90; ss by #6291, eff 7-20-96; ss by #8087, eff 5-27-04; ss by #10095, eff 2-29-12; ss by #12652, eff 10-27-18",
